 <h3><u>Haaza min karame hussain ibne ali</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>hussain.......(4) Ya hussain<br> Yabnaz zehra .....ya hussain,hussain hussain hussain, hussain. .....4<br> Ye meri izzato taukeer tera sadqa hai....2<br> Ye meri ashko ki jagir tera sadqa hai......2<br> Mujhko jo kuch bhi Mila maula tere dar se mila.......<br> Meri dhadkan se hamawaqt sadaa aati hai. ..<br> YA hussain......2<br> Haaza min karame Hussain ibne Ali......4</p> 
  <p>1. Sayyada fatema zehra ka huwa mujhpe karam, mil gaya farshe azaa aur alam,<br> Aur kya mangu bhalaaaa......2<br> tujhse mujhe kya na mila<br> ankh&nbsp; kholi to mujhe ghar me azakhana mila....<br> Jab alam dekha toh ye baat kahiiìiiii......<br> Haaza min karame Hussain ibne Ali......6</p> 
  <p>2. Mujhko maa baap se virse me milaa farshe aza, ye mukaddar na farishto ko mila,<br> tarbiyat aysi miliiiiiii.........2<br> Khud hi sajaata hu alam<br> Bhul jaata hu zamane ke sabhi ranjo alam,<br> Likhne wale ne ye taqdeer likhiiiii......<br> Haaza min karame Hussain ibne Ali......6</p> 
  <p>3. Aag par chalna, ye zanjeer zani aur kamaa,<br> Zindagi Jeete hai bas ehle aza,<br> Khoon tehleel huwaaaaaa.....2<br> Par na mujhe aayi qaza,<br> Ek zanjeer se das logoh ne maatam bhi kiya,<br> Khoon behne se meri maut tali...<br> Haaza min karame Hussain ibne Ali......6</p> 
  <p>4. Haath sine pe agar maaro toh ruk jaata hai dil,<br> Saas lene se bhi katrata hai dil,<br> Umr bhar karta rahaaaa.....2<br> Matame shabbir bapa<br> Na ruki Saas na is dilne dhadakna choda<br> Dilki dhadkan se sada aane lagiiiì.........<br> Haaza min karame Hussain ibne Ali......6</p> 
  <p>5. Aagaya mera bulawa jo sue karbobala<br> Mai bina zaade safar ghar se chaala<br> Ankh me ashke azaaaaa......2<br> Lab pe buka Sinaa zani<br> Jab chala ghar se mere sath tha saman yahi<br> KARBALA dekhi toh mai bola yahi<br> Haaza min karame Hussain ibne Ali......6</p> 
  <p>6. KARBALA ho ya MADINA ho ke MASHAD ya NAJAF<br> Har ziyarat ka mila mujhko sharaf<br> Saari duniya me gayaaaaa......2<br> Aur yahi nauha padha<br> Mai toh shabbir ka zakir hu meri baaat hi kya<br> Mujhko is dar se hi taukeer mili...<br> Haaza min karame Hussain ibne Ali......6</p> 
  <p>7. Mere hamraah wo karta hai aqide ka safar<br> Mere jaisa hai mera lakhte jigar<br> Kaam kuch aur nahiìiiii......2<br> Majliso matam ke siwa<br> Shukr sad shukr ke awlaad ko virsaa ye mila<br> Nauha padhta hai mera NAADE ALI......<br> Haaza min karame Hussain ibne Ali......6</p> 
  <p>8. Hur ke laashe pe juhi pohche shahen shahe huda<br> Aankh me ashq the aur lab pe bukaa<br> Hur ki peshani koooooo......2<br> Rumaal jo zahra ka mila<br> Apni taqdeer pe naaza vo dilafgaar huwa<br> Hur ke laashe se sadaa aane lagi<br> Haaza min karame Hussain ibne Ali......6</p> 
  <p>9. Roz ek nauha nayaa likhta hai MAZHAR ka kalam<br> Mujhpe maula ka hai ye khaas karam<br> Aur saitees barasssss.....2<br> Hogae irfaane azaa<br> Zikre shabbir&nbsp; se ek pal bhi tu ghaafil na raha<br> Hamne mimbar pe yahi baat kahiiiii.......<br> Haaza min karame Hussain&nbsp; ibne Ali......6</p> 
